shaded. </p>
<p>{@ineq1@}</p>
<p>{@ineq2@}</p>
<p>{@ineq3@}</p>
<p> By drawing the graph, or otherwise, find the coordinates of a point that would be in the shaded region </p><p>([[input:ans1]] ,[[input:ans2]] )[[validation:ans1]][[validation:ans2]][[feedback:prt1]]</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
